You only get converted when sacrificing when your alignment is
extremely low.  At the beginning of a game, your alignment usually
starts out at zero or close to it.  It isn't really long before it
starts taking off for the stratisphere, so just hold off trying to
convert altars for three or four experience levels.  It'll also
increase the conversion success chance.

